{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1529791-basic-info-about-sublime-danger","id":1529791,"title":"Basic info about Sublime Danger?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-01-31T18:26:23-08:00","id":1529791,"title":"Basic info about Sublime Danger?","content":"I just realized that I bought Lunars as an add-on during the Essence kickstarter, not the actual Lunars kickstarter, so I didn't have the option to get MFS. I can wait and get it on DriveThruRPG whenever it sees general release, but I do have a short term desire to get some info about Sublime Danger. <br /> <br /> One of my players (a Lunar) will be meeting an apprentice of Sublime Danger in our game this coming weekend. I wasn't expecting MFS to be out yet, so I was planning to improv some basic details about her beyond what it says in Fangs at the Gate. But now that MFS is out, I'd like to avoid any unnecessary retcons. <br /> <br /> Does MFS reveal anything surprising that couldn't be extrapolated from the little info in the Lunars book? If one of your players was going to learn some common knowledge about Sublime Danger, and maybe an insider secret that only one of her followers might know, what info would you give them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26886-lindharin","name":"Lindharin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-31T20:16:04-08:00","id":1529797,"title":"","content":"From a few years back and maybe outdated/imprecise, but i did come up across <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1417714-what-is-known-about-eternal-nova?p=1417732#post1417732\">this</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1393940-martial-arts-in-many-faced-strangers?p=1394055#post1394055\">this</a>.<br /> <br /> True or false, they do lend itself to some imagery, legendry or rumours to play &amp; tinker with for misdirection and drama.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-31T21:41:24-08:00","id":1529800,"title":"","content":"Thank you, I had forgotten about <i>Tale of the Visiting Flare</i>. I just reread it, and it gives some interesting tidbits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26886-lindharin","name":"Lindharin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-01T00:00:47-08:00","id":1529805,"title":"","content":"From MFS:<br /> <br /> - She's not only looking for her Solar mate, she's collecting stories on any other Scavenger Lands Exalted who might give her a challenge.<br /> - She has hideouts throughout the East, some in cities, some out in the wilds.<br /> - She enjoys hard-won battlefield victories, but she's also one for strategic sabotage, whether material, political, through someone's secrets, through someone's reputation, etc.<br /> - She wants to see the fall of Lookshy, the Realm, and the Immaculate religion, but she has no interest in what happens afterwards; that's someone else's business.<br /> - She's very generous with those of her students who do well under her, specifically with artifacts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-01T02:57:00-08:00","id":1529810,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1529791-basic-info-about-sublime-danger?p=1529805#post1529805\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From MFS:<br /> <br /> ...</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26886-lindharin","name":"Lindharin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}